{{Noncanon|Start}}
In {{SSBU}}, [[Sheik]] wears a set of Stealth Attire, though the [[Stealth Mask]] headgear is replaced with [[Sheik's Mask|Sheik Mask]].
{{Noncanon|End}}

==Trivia==
* Concept artwork of the Stealth Set from {{BotW}} shows that it originally resembled the everyday clothes worn by members of the [[Sheikah]] tribe.<ref name="CaC 180"/> However, the Stealth Set was later redesigned to resemble the clothes worn by Sheikah warriors instead.<ref name="CaC 103"/>

